tuwasi_butterfly_farm_amazon_animal_orphan","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.amazonanimalorphanage.org","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-25"},"hashtags":["pilpintuwasibutterflyfarmamazonanimalorphanage","iquitos"],"hours":{"week":[null,{"open":"09:00","close":"16:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:00"}],"note":"Closed Mon"},"summary":"At Pilpintuwasi you can see the complete life cycle and learn about the impressing development of butterflies. At the Amazon Animal Orphanage you can see the rescued endangered animals that were ill-treated, such as anteaters, monkeys, tapirs or Pedro Bello, the Jaguar. Pilpintuwasi is on the Nanay River Front near the village of Padre Cocha. It's about 20 min by boat from Bellavista-Nanay. There ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Iquitos"},{"id":"iquitos_wv_la_plaza_28_de_julio","areaId":"iquitos","name":"La Plaza 28 de Julio","category":"landmark","tags":["oldtown","photo"],"location":{"lat":-3.7544,"lng":-73.2493},"visitMinutes":30,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"iquitos_wv_la_plaza_28_de_julio","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-25"},"hashtags":["laplaza28dejulio","iquitos"],"bestLight":"golden","summary":"The biggest square in Peru, there are very good 'Chifa' (Peruvian Chinese) restaurants around the square.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Iquitos"},{"id":"iquitos_wv_dawn_on_the_amazon","areaId":"iquitos","name":"Dawn on the Amazon","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-3.7492,"lng":-73.2425},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"iquitos_wv_dawn_on_the_amazon","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["dawnontheamazon","iquitos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"07:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"07:30","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"Easy to find at the end of the boulevard on the corner of Nauta is the place to go to eat and meet. The food is excellent, it is right on the end of the boulevard with a beautiful view and it is the center to find out where to go in Iquitos. All the expats congregate each evening full of suggestions and great conversation. Live music and lively conversation.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Iquitos"},{"id":"iquitos_wv_amazon_bistro","areaId":"iquitos","name":"Amazon Bistro","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-3.7512,"lng":-73.2438},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"iquitos_wv_amazon_bistro","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["amazonbistro","iquitos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"06:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"06:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"06:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"06:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"06:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"06:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"06:00","close":"23:59"}]},"summary":"At one block from the main square, in front of the river, a French old-style brasserie. An excellent alternative to eat or to enjoy a drink thanks to the unique offers in town — real espresso, homemade bread, Argentinean steaks, Belgian beers, escargots, Belgian chocolate dessert. Live music on Friday and Saturday nights.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Iquitos"},{"id":"iquitos_wv_huasai_restaurant","areaId":"iquitos","name":"Huasaí Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":-3.7482,"lng":-73.2445},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"iquitos_wv_huasai_restaurant","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["huasairestaurant","iquitos"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"07:45","close":"15:30"},{"open":"07:45","close":"15:30"},{"open":"07:45","close":"15:30"},{"open":"07:45","close":"15:30"},{"open":"07:45","close":"15:30"},null,{"open":"07:45","close":"15:30"}],"no